  "what_this_does_not_show": [
    "one caller only: with several waiting callers the slot is shared by whoever's retry lands first, so a bigger budget does not buy the same thing per caller",
    "server-side queueing (--queue-wait-ms), which is a different mechanism with a different elapsed profile",
    "argos: only the madlad slot was measured, because that is the slot whose decodes are seconds long",
    "what the desktop UI should tolerate: this table says how long waiting recovers an answer, not how long a person will wait for one"
  ]
}
